  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "In Fedora 3.2, Akubra was integrated as an implementation of the LLStore interface.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "This work completes the transition to Akubra as the primary blob storage abstraction in Fedora by:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "Removing the LLStore Module and replacing it with an Akubra-based one",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      },
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "Ensuring that blob size is exposed via the API (to support ",
           "type": "text"
          },
          {
           "attrs": {
            "url": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-64#icft=FCREPO-64"
           },
           "type": "inlineCard"
          },
          {
           "text": ")",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      }
     ],
     "type": "bulletList"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "To ensure a smooth transition for existing Fedora users, it MUST be possible to:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "Continue using old LLStore implementations with Fedora",
           "type": "text"
          },
          {
           "type": "hardBreak"
          },
          {
           "text": "  (so an Akubra implementation backed by an LLStore implementation can be used for at least a release, while LLStore is being deprecated)",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      },
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "Migrate from any Akubra impl to any other Akubra impl (combined with the above, this makes it possible to migrate from LLStore-based storage to straight Akubra-based storage).  This is also useful for migrating storage wholly from one impl to another; a useful function in itself.",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      }
     ],
     "type": "bulletList"
    }
   ],
